WEBVTT

00:13:58.961 --> 00:14:00.478
kao što su pokušali

00:14:00.478 --> 00:14:02.052
kad je Ser Rodžer Banister

00:14:02.052 --> 00:14:04.190
pretrčao 1.600 metara
za manje od 4 minuta.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.817
Promena tehnologija, promena

00:14:05.817 --> 00:14:08.215
u genima i promena
u načinu razmišljanja.

00:14:08.215 --> 00:14:09.999
Inovacije u svetu sporta, bilo da su

00:14:09.999 --> 00:14:11.656
u pitanju nove podloge za trčanje

00:14:11.656 --> 00:14:13.120
ili nove plivačke tehnike,

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.990
demokratizacija sporta, uključivanje

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.331
novih građa tela,

00:14:16.331 --> 00:14:18.916
pa čak i novih populacija,

00:14:18.916 --> 00:14:20.969
i mašta u sportu, pronicanje

00:14:20.969 --> 00:14:22.405
u mogućnosti ljudskog tela,

00:14:22.405 --> 00:14:24.186
su zajedno učinili

00:14:24.186 --> 00:14:26.078
da sportisti postanu jači,

00:14:26.078 --> 00:14:28.601
brži, smeliji

00:14:28.601 --> 00:14:30.578
i bolji nego ikad ranije.